    <!--
        2026-08-21: compactLayoutAssignment switched from SYSTEM to Disposition_Compact_Layput.
        This drives the highlights panel at the top of the Disposition record page (the field
        strip directly under the record name/breadcrumb), not the record body.

        ⚠ API-NAME TYPO IS DELIBERATE, DO NOT "FIX" IT. The compact layout's real fullName is
        Disposition_Compact_Layput (missing the 'o'), created by the user in Setup on
        2026-08-20T19:44:53Z. A future reader searching the repo for "Disposition_Compact_Layout"
        will find nothing and may wrongly conclude the file is missing - it lives at
        force-app/main/default/objects/Disposition__c/compactLayouts/Disposition_Compact_Layput.compactLayout-meta.xml
        with fullName/label matching the typo exactly. Renaming it here would desync from the
        org's actual API name and break the assignment below.

        Neither On_Market nor Off_Market recordType-meta.xml carries its own
        compactLayoutAssignment, so this single object-level assignment governs BOTH record
        types - there is no per-record-type override to also update.
    -->
    <compactLayoutAssignment>Disposition_Compact_Layput</compactLayoutAssignment>
